title Class structure — Wait in the Lobby

class LobbyPage <<frontend, game>> {
  +room: Signal<RoomState>
  +canStart: Signal<boolean>
  +messages: Signal<LobbyMessage[]> (three at most)
  +copyLink(): void
  +startTheRace(): void
  +leave(): void
}
class PlayerList <<frontend, components>> {
  +players: InputSignal<RoomPlayerState[]>
  +ownPlayerId: InputSignal<string>
  +capacity: InputSignal<number>
}
class FriendsGame <<frontend, game>> {
  +room: Signal<RoomState>
  +ownPlayerId: string
  +startGame(): Promise<void>
  +leave(): Promise<void>
}
interface RoomConnection <<frontend, api>> {
  +open(token: string): Promise<void>
  +startGame(): Promise<void>
  +leaveRoom(): Promise<void>
  +onRoomChanged(handler): void
  +gameChanged(handler): void
  +close(): Promise<void>
}
class RoomState <<frontend, api>> {
  +code: string
  +status: RoomStatus
  +setup: GameSetup
  +players: RoomPlayerState[]
}
class RoomPlayerState <<frontend, api>> {
  +id: string
  +kid: KidId
  +nickname: Nickname
  +isHost: boolean
}
class RoomHub {
  +OnConnectedAsync(): Task
  +StartGame(): Task
  +LeaveRoom(): Task
}
class StartGameCommandHandler {
  +Handle(command: StartGameCommand): Task
}
class LeaveRoomCommandHandler {
  +Handle(command: LeaveRoomCommand): Task
}
class Room {
  +RoomStatus Status
  +GameSetup Setup
  +Start(by: RoomPlayer, now: DateTimeOffset): void
  +Leave(player: RoomPlayer): void
  +bool IsEmpty
}
class RoomPlayer {
  +Guid Id
  +bool IsHost
  +DateTimeOffset JoinedAt
}
interface IRoomNotifier {
  +RoomChanged(room: Room): Task
  +GameChangedAsync(roomId, game: GameStateDto): Task
}

LobbyPage --> PlayerList : shows
LobbyPage ..> FriendsGame : reads through ROOM_SESSION
FriendsGame ..> RoomConnection : uses through ROOM_CONNECTION
FriendsGame --> RoomState : holds
RoomState *-- "1..8" RoomPlayerState
RoomConnection ..> RoomHub : hub methods and events
RoomHub ..> StartGameCommandHandler : sends StartGameCommand
RoomHub ..> LeaveRoomCommandHandler : sends LeaveRoomCommand
StartGameCommandHandler --> Room : loads / mutates
LeaveRoomCommandHandler --> Room : loads / mutates / deletes
StartGameCommandHandler ..> IRoomNotifier : announces
LeaveRoomCommandHandler ..> IRoomNotifier : announces
Room *-- "0..8" RoomPlayer
@enduml
